/Title (A multi-core cloud VM serves short, interactive API requests alongside long-running batch analytics jobs. Under plain FCFS scheduling, one long batch job blocks every short request behind it \(the convoy effect\), and frequent process creation fragments memory as short-lived handler processes are spawned and destroyed.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1508 0 R
